<%= if @order.customer_first_name do %><%= gettext("Hi %{name},", name: @order.customer_first_name) %><% else %><%= gettext("Hi,") %><% end %>

<%= gettext("Nobody was home when I delivered your flowers, so I left them in the spot shown in the attached photo.") %>

<%= gettext("Thank you for your order. If you can't find them, just reply and I'll help.") %>

<%= gettext("Warm wishes,") %>

Jennie
Eden Flowers
